h a routine and the you  illness fades that's why your deciding  factor will probably be the other stuff  these watches can do if you want deeper  notifications and information on your  wrist go with the Apple watch I love how  the blaze limits notifications to just  calendar texts and calls but I use the  Apple watch quite often to see my daily  schedule check the temperature outside  and quickly respond to a text the police  doesn't have those features okay here's  what I would do if you have an iPhone  and want a smart watch that's good at  fitness tracking get the Apple watch  sport but if you just want a good  fitness tracker that also tells the time  save your money and get the 130 dollar  Fitbit charge HR Fitbit has a ways to go  on providing the SmartWatch essentials  and deeper utility in fitness and health  welcome to the next lap in the race
 

